      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Did the recommendations lead to purchases?** A pick counts as bought when the customer bought that product (any colour) within 90 days of the send - read from the real purchase data. Cards are shown in a random order, so *slot* (which logic) and *position* (where in the email) are measured separately. Ranges = 95% bootstrap interval. In the 2019-2020 replay nobody received the email, so emailed vs holdout is an A/A check: its range should include 0. Opens and clicks would come from a website's tracking (not part of this build)."
      }
    },
